{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2>&quot;Rumors, huh...&quot;<br>&quot;It must be that one, right?&quot;<br>&quot;Actually... the master once had a lover.&quot;<br><br>In the early 20th century, within a secluded manor untouched by the chaos of the times, a &quot;maid&quot; named Anna diligently carries out her daily tasks, living a monotonous yet peaceful life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/CG_03_1merge.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><br>However, an unexpected recollection stirs a void in Anna's memory, swallowing him whole. Unusual behavior from colleagues, a confused sense of gender, fragmented awareness, and hazy dreams\u2014what was once a peaceful existence is now overshadowed by an eerie atmosphere. Just as Anna struggles to make sense of it all, time begins to move again, and a group of unfamiliar visitors arrives at the manor, quietly unraveling a long-hidden mystery.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/2.jpg?t=1745221721\" /><br><br>As the curtain rises, an orchestrated series of unexpected events unfolds. The so-called relatives of the manor's owner display blatant inconsistencies\u2014conflicting identities, ages, and relationships. Do these contradictions connect to the unease they exude? Words that should not exist begin to echo in Anna\u2019s mind\u2014what role do they play in this story?<br><br>With the stage set and fate in motion, will &quot;Anna&quot; be pushed to the unknown fringes of reality, or will they be drawn into the very heart of the story\u2019s vortex?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Gameplay</h2>-Work: Mini-games (cockroach-swatting, puzzles, etc...)<br>-Exploration: Interact with various maid NPCs<br>-Mystery-solving: Investigate and uncover the truth<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/3.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/5.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/6.png?t=1745221721\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Features</h2>-12 CG illustrations<br>-2 chibi-style illustrations<br>-9 black-and-white illustrations, 3 full-color illustrations<br>-Suspenseful mystery-driven narrative with 3 bonus side stories","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436130?t=1745221721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3436130?t=1745221721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/525b3d9bc3b7e0dcc78cd681cf75fcc4659dff98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745221721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/525b3d9bc3b7e0dcc78cd681cf75fcc4659dff98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745221721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains General Mature Content/Mild violence/Bloody scenes."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Story</h2>&quot;Rumors, huh...&quot;<br>&quot;It must be that one, right?&quot;<br>&quot;Actually... the master once had a lover.&quot;<br><br>In the early 20th century, within a secluded manor untouched by the chaos of the times, a &quot;maid&quot; named Anna diligently carries out her daily tasks, living a monotonous yet peaceful life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/CG_03_1merge.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><br>However, an unexpected recollection stirs a void in Anna's memory, swallowing him whole. Unusual behavior from colleagues, a confused sense of gender, fragmented awareness, and hazy dreams\u2014what was once a peaceful existence is now overshadowed by an eerie atmosphere. Just as Anna struggles to make sense of it all, time begins to move again, and a group of unfamiliar visitors arrives at the manor, quietly unraveling a long-hidden mystery.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/2.jpg?t=1745221721\" /><br><br>As the curtain rises, an orchestrated series of unexpected events unfolds. The so-called relatives of the manor's owner display blatant inconsistencies\u2014conflicting identities, ages, and relationships. Do these contradictions connect to the unease they exude? Words that should not exist begin to echo in Anna\u2019s mind\u2014what role do they play in this story?<br><br>With the stage set and fate in motion, will &quot;Anna&quot; be pushed to the unknown fringes of reality, or will they be drawn into the very heart of the story\u2019s vortex?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Gameplay</h2>-Work: Mini-games (cockroach-swatting, puzzles, etc...)<br>-Exploration: Interact with various maid NPCs<br>-Mystery-solving: Investigate and uncover the truth<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/3.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/5.png?t=1745221721\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436130/extras/6.png?t=1745221721\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 Features</h2>-12 CG illustrations<br>-2 chibi-style illustrations<br>-9 black-and-white illustrations, 3 full-color illustrations<br>-Suspenseful mystery-driven narrative with 3 bonus side stories","developers":["\u963f\u9b6f","BlueBerry \u85cd\u8393\u793e"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams